    "rationale": "Relocate nodes 7, 5, 9, and 11 to compress the y-span from 12→7 tiles (min_y=22, max_y=28→26) and eliminate vertical congestion at x=22 and x=24: moving 7 to (22,25) and 5 to (22,24) aligns the ~in2→w1→w2 chain vertically with no detour; moving 9 to (20,24) shortens [9,7] from 5→3 steps by enabling a direct horizontal-to-vertical turn at y=24; moving 11 to (23,26) reduces [11,3] from 4→3 steps and avoids the congested y=28 corridor. The routing order prioritizes PI-driven wires first, then early fanin consolidation ([4,5], [8,9]), followed by shared fanin ([5,7], [9,7]) before reconvergent outputs ([11,3], [7,3]) to prevent blocking."
